# Feature Specification: Support duplex printing profiles per printer

**Project:** Print Server / TDI
**Type:** Feature
**Priority:** Low
**Dev estimate:** 8.0h
**QA estimate:** 2.0h

## Overview

Add per-printer duplex profile configuration. Operators should be able to define default duplex mode (none, long-edge, short-edge) per printer. Profile must persist across server restarts.

